  Description: 'Whether due to a velstrac''s manipulations or a planar jaunt gone
    horribly wrong, your bloodline was infused with a vein of shadow. Spell List
    occult Bloodline Skills Occultism, Stealth Granted Spells cantrip: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Void
    Warp]; 1st: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Grim Tendrils]; 2nd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Darkness];
    3rd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Chilling Darkness]; 4th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Phantasmal
    Killer]; 5th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Shadow Siphon]; 6th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Collective
    Transposition]; 7th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Duplicate Foe]; 8th:
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Disappearance]; 9th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Weird]
    Bloodline Spells initial: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Dim the Light];
    advanced: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Steal Shadow]; greater: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Consuming
    Darkness] Blood Magic Shadows grow deeper around you or one target, either granting
    a +1 status bonus to Stealth or imposing a -1 status penalty to Perception for
    1 round. @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Shadow Blood Magic]'
